42
00:02:58,320 --> 00:02:59,880
There are many fellow cultivators here !

43
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:01,080
Don't act recklessly !

44
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,400
Outsiders of the Heavenly Fate Sect

45
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,840
will not interfere

46
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:07,800
in this internal strife.

47
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,120
Seventh Brother,

48
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,200
