49
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:11,600
The competition

50
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:12,800
isn't today.

51
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:14,640
You don't get to decide

52
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:16,480
