53
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:18,200
or not !

54
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,600
Heaven and Earth Mantra of Freedom !

55
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,400
This is Master's birthday.

56
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:46,080
You wouldn't dare to kill me !

57
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:47,800
You won't kill me !

58
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:55,880
Wang Lin,

59
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:57,760
you dared to kill a direct disciple !?

60
00:04:01,480 --> 00:04:02,400
He's too bold !

61
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,160
Indeed...

62
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:06,880
It's your turn now.

63
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:09,400
Wang Lin broke the sect rules

64
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:10,440
by killing a disciple !

65
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:12,000
Where are the Disciplinary Elders ?

66
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:16,040
Whoever stands in my way

67
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:18,400
is my enemy !

68
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:20,840
This...

69
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,440
You guys !

70
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,400
Fourth Sister !

71
00:04:32,320 --> 00:04:33,440
I already repaid

72
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:35,280
the favor I owed you.

73
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,520
Give me a good reason

74
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:38,800
to intervene.

75
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:45,440
Fine !

76
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,400
Fine !

77
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:34,680
I wanted to save this for the competition...

78
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,120
But we will

79
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:38,640
settle this now with a fight to the death !

80
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:48,040
Master actually planted a demon seed inside him !?

81
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:49,720
That's unfair !

82
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,240
This is bad !

83
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:38,760
What is that !?

84
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:55,920
God Slaying Chariot,

85
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:57,000
