86
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:08,080
Stop this at once !

87
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:26,160
What are you even fighting for ?

88
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:28,600
You didn't even let me finish my wine...

89
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:31,040
Greetings

90
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:32,880
Uncle Chi Lie.

91
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:35,160
Calling me Uncle won't save you.

92
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:38,080
You forcefully used the demon seed before it was ready.

93
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:39,720
Your Master said

94
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:42,120
that you are banned from participating

95
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:43,560
in the competition.

96
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:46,920
No...

97
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:47,800
Impossible !

98
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,920
I cultivated 1000 years for this !

99
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:54,160
Disciple

100
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,400
obeys...

101
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,400
Little guy,

102
00:07:59,880 --> 00:08:01,400
without the demon seed

103
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,800
you would have won.

104
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:03,680
Not bad !

105
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:06,840
The position of Violet Son of Tian Yun is vacant.

106
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:08,360
Your Master

107
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:10,680
has high hopes for you.

108
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:15,280
The Juniors of the Violet Division just caused a ruckus,

109
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:16,920
and ruined the mood.

110
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,840
I hope everyone will forgive us.

111
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:19,840
Tomorrow,

112
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:23,320
my Senior Brother the All-Seer will give a lecture on the Dao.

113
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:25,760
I hope everyone will benefit from it

114
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:27,800
and make this event worth your time.

115
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:34,680
So that ghost was an Ancient Demon,

116
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:37,400
it gave me the same feeling as an Ancient God.

117
00:08:38,160 --> 00:08:39,680
What was that spell ?

118
00:08:39,800 --> 00:08:40,600
Seventh Brother !

119
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:44,000
It seems the title Son of Tian Yun is within your grasp.

120
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:47,480
Let me toast to your success in advance.

121
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:50,000
This is the Teleportation spell I promised.

122
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,280
I originally planned to give it to you

123
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:53,680
after Master's birthday.

124
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:56,400
Besides the Teleportation Spell, this jade slip

125
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:58,840
also contains a Forbidden Spell created by Master.

126
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:00,920
I give them both to you

127
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:03,240
as an apology for what happened a month ago.

128
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,040
Young friend !

129
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,920
The younger generation is formidable !

130
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:06,480
Fellow cultivator,

131
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,600
let's toast to your success !

132
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:10,320
Purple Forest Pavilion

133
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:33,600
This Teleportation spell is very powerful.

134
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,640
I crossed 10 000 li

135
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:36,840
in an instant.

136
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:42,840
The Forbidden Spell recorded in the jade slip,

137
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:44,720
the Nine Cycles Celestial Refining Tactic,

138
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,320
is used to transform celestial spiritual energy

139
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:48,320
into golden celestial spiritual energy.

140
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:50,800
I painstakingly circulated it for 5 hours

141
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,440
but I'm only at the third cycle.

142
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:55,840
Unfortunately, the two types of celestial spiritual energy are incompatible.

143
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:58,520
I will store it in my left hand for now.

144
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,640
The day of the lecture

145
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,600
has finally arrived.

146
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:14,000
Main Palace of the\NHeavenly Fate Sect

147
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:34,640
I heard the Violet Division is the weakest

148
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:35,480
and lacks talent.

149
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:37,240
It seems it's true.

150
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,400
Keep your voice down !

151
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:40,640
Silence.

152
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:52,280
Late stage Soul Transformation...

153
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,560
Peak Late stage Soul Transformation...

154
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:58,400
Half-step Ascendant ?

155
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:01,000
On planet Tian Yun, just the disciples

156
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:03,040
of any single division

157
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:05,080
could sweep planet Suzaku.

158
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:28,400
We pay respects to the All-Seer !

159
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:28,400
We pay respects to Master !

160
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:40,400
I am the All-Seer.

161
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,800
I cultivated for tens of thousands of years

162
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:45,080
and glimpsed at the Dao of the heavens.

163
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,920
In this lecture on the Dao,

164
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:52,000
I wish to share my cultivation insights with you all.

165
00:11:57,480 --> 00:12:00,000
I didn't expect you to send an avatar,

166
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:02,400
it's an honor.

167
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:08,840
How could I not come

168
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:12,120
to your once in 10 000 years birthday !

169
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:16,120
This little weasel...

170
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,600
I arrived in a hurry

171
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:19,280
so couldn't prepare any good gifts.

172
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:21,120
I know you like things with seven colors.

173
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:21,000
Sun Zhongan\NEnvoy of the Cultivation Alliance

174
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:23,440
This sword is an upper middle grade celestial artifact.

175
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:24,800
Its golden color

176
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:26,440
should suit your taste.

177
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:31,400
Kunpeng Zi,

178
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:34,160
your cultivation has made great progress lately.

179
00:12:34,680 --> 00:12:36,880
I bestow this sword to you.

180
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,400
Thank you Master !

181
00:12:41,400 --> 00:12:42,600
Your attitude

182
00:12:42,920 --> 00:12:44,560
still hasn't changed !

183
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,840
This is a Star-Marked Weasel,

184
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:49,600
a pet that loves Ancient Gods.

185
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:54,520
Could it have sensed the faint Ancient God aura on me ?

186
00:12:58,280 --> 00:12:59,840
The Dao of Heavenly Fate

187
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:01,880
is infinitely profound.

188
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:04,360
Fellow cultivators,

189
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:06,480
if you have doubts, please ask me.

190
00:13:08,920 --> 00:13:10,160
The Heaveny Art

191
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:12,880
is about seeing the 99 cycles as one origin.

192
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:14,600
The first step

193
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,480
from Qi Condensation

194
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:18,600
all the way to Ascendant

195
00:13:19,040 --> 00:13:20,480
is cultivation.

196
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:23,200
The second step

197
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:25,640
from Illusory Yin and Corporeal Yang

198
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:27,920
to the 3 stages of Nirvana Shattering

199
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:33,040
is the transition between cultivation and the Dao.

200
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:35,120
And the third step

201
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:37,720
is the true essence of the Dao.

202
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:40,680
Sadly, even I haven't comprehended it yet.

203
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:43,400
My Dao of Heavenly Fate is:

204
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:44,920
if that if you are fated,

205
00:13:44,920 --> 00:13:46,720
you can achieve anything.

206
00:13:47,280 --> 00:13:48,760
But if you are not fated,

207
00:13:49,400 --> 00:13:50,920
10 000 years of cultivation

208
00:13:51,160 --> 00:13:53,600
will not amount to anything.

209
00:13:55,760 --> 00:13:57,600
If what the All-Seer says is true

210
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:00,120
then I haven't even finished the first step.

211
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:03,000
But does the third step

212
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:05,600
even exist ?

213
00:14:09,520 --> 00:14:10,400
Wang Lin,

214
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:13,080
do you have any questions ?

215
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:14,720
Master,

216
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:16,720
disciple indeed has a question.

217
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:17,800
Speak up.

218
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:19,880
On the path of cultivation

219
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:21,320
I have heard of 3 terms.

220
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,360
Cultivating immortality,

221
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:23,320
cultivating truth,

222
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:24,160
cultivating the Dao.

223
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:26,800
Why does Master only refer to it as cultivating the Dao

224
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:28,000
and not the others ?

225
00:14:28,640 --> 00:14:30,000
A good question.

226
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:32,360
The Celestials are gone.

227
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:35,800
Cultivating immortality came from the ancient celestials.

228
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:40,000
The Celestial Realm was the holy land of cultivation back then.

229
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:43,080
Hence the saying "cultivating immortality".

230
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:45,640
The "truth" in "cultivating truth"

231
00:14:45,640 --> 00:14:47,120
is the source of everything.

232
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:50,000
After the Celestial Realm shattered,

233
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:52,680
cultivators were like trees without roots.

234
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:55,200
Homeless and drifting in the void.

235
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:58,680
That's how "cultivating truth" became the core of cultivation.

236
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:01,360
And now,

237
00:15:01,640 --> 00:15:04,640
both immortality and truth are things of the past.

238
00:15:05,640 --> 00:15:07,520
What we seek is the Dao.

239
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:09,920
But this kind of Dao

240
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:12,200
is not the Dao of the heavens.

241
00:15:13,570 --> 00:15:16,120
How can you cultivate the Dao but not follow the Dao of the heavens ?

242
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:17,680
Then what is the Dao ?

243
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:21,120
The "Dao" in "cultivating the Dao"

244
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:22,800
is a path, a direction.

245
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:26,680
Because we don't know what the third step is,

246
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:30,400
we are looking for a path to reach it.

247
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:31,960
This

248
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:35,440
is what the "Dao" in "cultivating the Dao" means.

249
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,120
Wang Lin,

250
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:39,280
does that answer your question ?

251
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:41,600
Disciple wonders

252
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:43,720
if the third step even exists.

253
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:47,000
30 000 years ago,

254
00:15:47,400 --> 00:15:49,320
I met a person

255
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:52,000
who had already reached the third step.

256
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:55,440
Unfortunately, he only appeared for a short time

257
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:58,680
and then disappeared.

258
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:03,720
Master,

259
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:05,200
disciple also has a question.

260
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:11,000
Master,

261
00:16:11,560 --> 00:16:12,560
disciple has a question.

262
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:18,480
3 days later

263
00:16:18,880 --> 00:16:20,600
Is everyone satisfied

264
00:16:21,280 --> 00:16:23,240
after these 3 days of lecture ?

265
00:16:29,400 --> 00:16:31,280
Old man All-Seer,

266
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:35,840
how could I not come to your birthday !?

267
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,480
It's Sword Saint Ling Tianhou !

268
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:41,440
It's Ling Tianhou !

269
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:42,160
It's him !

270
00:16:42,400 --> 00:16:43,200
Why did he come ?

271
00:16:43,400 --> 00:16:44,480
Why is Ling Tianhou here ?

272
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:46,000
Disciples,

273
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:49,520
come pay respects to Senior All-Seer !

274
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:55,520
Old man All-Seer,

275
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:56,720
so...

276
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:58,880
why aren't you welcoming me ?

277
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,640
How could I not ?

278
00:17:01,640 --> 00:17:05,000
I was just preparing to demonstrate a middle grade celestial spell.

279
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:06,360
You

280
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:09,240
have come at the right time.

281
00:17:11,120 --> 00:17:12,120
Now,

282
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:15,880
I will target you with this celestial spell

283
00:17:16,320 --> 00:17:19,320
and let everyone present observe it.

284
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:20,800
What do you think ?

285
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:24,280
Why not ?

286
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:27,640
Fellow cultivators,

287
00:17:28,280 --> 00:17:31,040
this is the middle grade Celestial Guidance Spell.

288
00:17:31,040 --> 00:17:33,080
It was used by ancient celestials

289
00:17:33,080 --> 00:17:36,400
to send cultivators like us to the Celestial Realm.

290
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:38,200
Everyone,

291
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:40,920
pay close attention.

292
00:17:42,080 --> 00:17:43,400
Celestial Gate,

293
00:17:43,840 --> 00:17:44,800
open !

294
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:03,900
This spell...

295
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:07,000
it's disrupting my celestial spiritual energy.

296
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:11,400
Somehow the golden celestial spiritual energy is not affected !

297
00:18:16,600 --> 00:18:18,200
Guidance !

298
00:18:28,080 --> 00:18:28,800
All-Seer,

299
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:29,720
you...

300
00:18:47,280 --> 00:18:49,800
I am the Celestial Realm's Eternal Envoy,

301
00:18:50,600 --> 00:18:53,920
I am here to guide you cultivators from lower realms.

302
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:08,600
Old man All-Seer...

303
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:10,600
The Celestial Realm is no more !

304
00:19:11,320 --> 00:19:12,640
Where did your Celestial Guidance Spell

305
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:15,760
send all my disciples !?

306
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:18,800
Sword Saint, don't worry.

307
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:22,320
They will return here in 3 days.

308
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:26,920
At that time, I will need to borrow a few of your disciples

309
00:19:27,120 --> 00:19:30,320
to ask them what they saw.

310
00:19:34,040 --> 00:19:34,720
Qilin,

311
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:36,160
come back !

312
00:19:39,600 --> 00:19:40,600
Old man All-Seer,

313
00:19:41,120 --> 00:19:42,120
3 months from now

314
00:19:42,480 --> 00:19:44,360
bring the people you have chosen

315
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:46,120
to the East Demon Spirit Sea.

316
00:19:48,400 --> 00:19:50,200
I have one more thing

317
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:52,840
that I want everyone to see.

318
00:19:53,880 --> 00:19:56,480
Among my 7 divisions of the Heavenly Fate Sect,

319
00:19:56,880 --> 00:19:58,680
the Yellow and Violet divisions

320
00:19:58,680 --> 00:20:01,720
still don't have Sons of Tian Yun.

321
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:04,480
Today

322
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:07,120
is the day of the competition

323
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:11,200
for the Seven Sons of Tian Yun.

324
00:20:12,600 --> 00:20:13,920
Are you all

325
00:20:14,760 --> 00:20:17,200
ready to begin ?

326
00:20:27,360 --> 00:20:33,000
I've been walking this path for endless years

327
00:20:29,660 --> 00:20:33,000
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

328
00:20:33,640 --> 00:20:38,600
Is it the compass of fate

329
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:38,600
that wrote this outcome for us ?

330
00:20:38,760 --> 00:20:44,520
The heavens want to erase your existence,

331
00:20:44,640 --> 00:20:50,240
that's the obsession guiding me.

332
00:20:50,520 --> 00:20:55,840
Is this the path to uncover

333
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:55,840
truths from falsehoods ?

334
00:20:56,120 --> 00:21:01,440
In a world of murk and shadow,

335
00:20:58,020 --> 00:21:01,440
only the flame of truth can light the way.

336
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:07,160
Look at them all,

337
00:21:04,360 --> 00:21:07,160
being carried by the waves.

338
00:21:07,600 --> 00:21:11,800
Look at them all,

339
00:21:09,760 --> 00:21:11,800
being drowned.

340
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:15,120
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

341
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:18,200
I will let the world refine my soul.

342
00:21:18,330 --> 00:21:23,760
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

343
00:21:20,020 --> 00:21:23,760
I will fight.

344
00:21:23,760 --> 00:21:26,880
I'll break through the abyss of despair

345
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:29,920
to finally learn who I really am.

346
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:35,280
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

347
00:21:31,800 --> 00:21:35,280
I embrace this obsession.

348
00:21:35,280 --> 00:21:38,240
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

349
00:21:38,240 --> 00:21:41,040
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

350
00:21:41,040 --> 00:21:46,520
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

351
00:21:43,080 --> 00:21:46,520
I'll still fight.

352
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:49,880
It's hard to avoid loneliness

353
00:21:49,880 --> 00:21:52,920
when you are above everyone else.

354
00:21:52,920 --> 00:21:58,600
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

355
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:58,600
be afraid of a firefly ?
